   "text": {
    "L1": "A strange noise warns the wife that someone may be inside.",
    "L2": "The thief hides and waits for the couple to sleep.",
    "L3": "The couple discuss naming a baby Rama, but this is their secret plan.",
    "L4": "Calling Rama louder and louder can bring the kotwal without warning the thief.",
    "L5": "The thief thinks they are only chatting about a name.",
    "L6": "Rama, the village kotwal, hears the call and arrests the thief.",
    "L7": "The couple stay calm and think quickly instead of fighting in the dark.",
    "L8": "The story teaches presence of mind: a clever, safe plan can bring help."
